	quest.57FD7ECA30255C9C.quest_subtitle: "Hardmode only"
	quest.58275DB6DF066451.quest_desc: [
		"Pretty intuitive to use, you just power one and it will power its adjacent cogs, up to 14 blocks away, just like with &aRedstone Dust&r. "
		"{image:fzzy_config:textures/gui/sprites/widget/popup/divider.png width:200 height:15 align:center}"
		"The real use for this is to be able to make compact vertical redstone signaling."
