	quest.5ED9CA7C6BFDA5FE.quest_subtitle: "Changes the font of objects it interacts with."
	quest.5EFDC9F7CE8F828E.quest_subtitle: "Unleash a sweeping melee attack in the form of a wreath of flames. This spell is uninterruptible. The damage scales off of your held weapon's melee damage and enchantments."
