		"You need to build a rectangular prism-shaped structure."
		""
		"-The edges must be made of Induction Casings&r."
		""
		"-The sides (faces) can be made of Induction Casings&r, Structural Glass&r, or Induction Ports&r."
		""
		"-It’s recommended to have two Induction Ports&r — one for input and one for output."
		""
