		"This machine purifies ores: 1 raw ingot becomes 2 clumps."
		""
		"This machine refines ores efficiently: 1 raw ingot produces 2 clumps."
		""
		"Process the clumps in a Crusher to get Dirty Dust, then use an Enrichment Chamber to make Clean Dust, and finally smelt it back into an ingot."
		""
		"A way to multiple your materials :D!"
		""
		"(too much work though)"
	]
